<title>JAPAN: Japan Apr service price index rises 1.4 yr/yr -- BOJ.</title>
<headline>Japan Apr service price index rises 1.4 yr/yr -- BOJ.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's corporate service price index (CSPI) rose 1.4 percent in April from a year earlier, and increased 1.8 percent from a month earlier, the Bank of Japan (BOJ) said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The overall index stood at 103.7 for April.</p>
<p>The index tracks price movements in the service industry and uses 1990 as its base year.</p>
<p>The following are percentage changes in components of the index year-on-year and month-on-month for April:</p>
<p>			    YEAR-ON-YEAR	    MONTH-ON-MONTH</p>
<p> Finance/Insurance     +0.8			+0.6</p>
<p> Real estate	     +1.2			+1.7</p>
<p> Transport		 +1.5			+1.3</p>
<p> Information services  +2.7			+2.6</p>
<p> Communications	  -0.1			+1.3</p>
<p> Advertising services  +3.0			+2.3</p>
<p> Lease/rental services -3.0			+1.5</p>
<p> Other services	  +2.3			+2.2</p>
</text>
